{"id":"soglasie","lemma":"согласие","pos":"noun","rank":2553,"glosses":["consent, assent","agreement","accord, accordance, concord, harmony"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8c/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%BB%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%BB%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"согласия","plural":"согласия"},"examples":[{"text":"Том дал мне согласие.","en":"Tom gave me the go-ahead.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to give","l":"дать"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null]},{"text":"Я не могу жениться без согласия родителей.","en":"I can't get married without my parents' permission.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to get married"},{"g":"without"},null,null]},{"text":"Я дам согласие на развод.","en":"I will consent to the divorce.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to give","l":"дать"},null,{"g":"on / at"},{"g":"divorce"}]},{"text":"Мы согласились не искать согласия.","en":"We agreed to disagree.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to agree","l":"согласиться"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to look for, to seek"},null]},{"text":"Я принял их молчание за согласие.","en":"I interpreted their silence as consent.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to take","l":"принять"},{"g":"them / their"},{"g":"silence (action or…"},{"g":"behind / for"},null]}]}